OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fcloudy in the north and west with
OL,7,Fpatchy drizzle possible where the
OL,8,Fcloud thickens. Dry elsewhere with
OL,9,Fclear breaks in the south and east.
OL,10,FThese leading to a risk of some mist
OL,11,Fand fog patches developing by dawn.
